  sentences:
  - It has been a week since grandma passed away...
  - Mom found this envelope in grandma's room which had my name on it
  - '''If you are reading this, I have already left the world'''
  - '''We used to spend all day playing and solving puzzles'''
  - '''You grew up and eventually left the house'''
  - '''I have one final message for you but you need to find it on your own'''
  - '''For every crossword puzzle in the evelope, you will get one word'''
  - '''Good luck grandchild!'''
